<title>INDIA: India RBi says purchased $2.329 bln in March 1997.</title>
<headline>India RBi says purchased $2.329 bln in March 1997.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India purchased $2.329 billion in March 1997 and did not make any sales during the month, the central bank said.</p>
<p>Cumulative purchases over end March 1996 were $7.8 billion, it said in its monthly bulletin for May 1997 made available to Reuters on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Outstanding net forward sales at the end of March 1997 were $345 million, it said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 900</p>
